[x] is_full_stack always derived as has_frontend AND has_backend (never trusted from LLM)
[x] CI/CD workflow branching — full with GitHub Pages (has_frontend=True)
                              — backend-only, no deploy (has_frontend=False)
[x] CLAUDE.md committed to generated repos after README (AI agent context file)
[x] Post-completion pipeline: CI workflow → README → CLAUDE.md
